{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are reviewing an implementation plan for a GPU prover optimization. Read these files and then review the plan:\n\n1. `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt/review_guideline.md` — the review standard to follow\n2. `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt/context.md` — project context\n3. `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md` — the task being planned\n4. `/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/2026-04-15-0800-arena-merkle-tree-digest-layers/plan.md` — the plan to review\n\nAdditionally, read the current source code that the plan modifies:\n- `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/merkle_tree.rs` — the Merkle tree implementation\n- `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-common/src/d_buffer.rs` — the DeviceBuffer implementation (especially `from_raw_parts_non_owning`)\n\n**Review this plan following the review guideline.** Check the plan against the actual source code. Verify:\n- The claimed bottleneck matches measurements\n- The proposed mechanism is correct against the actual code\n- The plan is specific enough to implement without inventing missing design\n- The expected savings are realistic\n\nReturn your response in the format: Findings, Improvements, Assessment."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Gyq7DFJwFwKQtVPkm2Sa3z","session_id":"f4b22a1a-5187-493b-801a-a22317879818","uuid":"96b94a2d-e6e7-4d9b-9045-eb9c61eeb9d4","timestamp":"2026-04-15T03:56:02.360Z"}
